{"type":"standard","title":"Lynne Walz","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lynne Walz</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q52637290","titles":{"canonical":"Lynne_Walz","normalized":"Lynne Walz","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lynne Walz</span></span>"},"pageid":57303840,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1378510192","tid":"eea7c462-c034-11f1-8f0a-83f616150bb1","timestamp":"2026-10-04T20:48:20Z","description":"American politician (born 1963)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lynne_Walz","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lynne_Walz?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lynne_Walz?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lynne_Walz"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lynne_Walz","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Lynne_Walz","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lynne_Walz?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lynne_Walz"}},"extract":"Lynne Marie Walz is an American politician, former teacher, and realtor, who served as a Nebraska state senator in the Nebraska Legislature from 2017 to 2025. A member of the Democratic Party, she represented District 15, which includes Fremont and surrounding areas.","extract_html":"<p><b>Lynne Marie Walz</b> is an American politician, former teacher, and realtor, who served as a Nebraska state senator in the Nebraska Legislature from 2017 to 2025. A member of the Democratic Party, she represented District 15, which includes Fremont and surrounding areas.</p>"}